OL,3,GNEWSAI was fired from The Voice - I
OL,4,Adidn't want to leave, says Sir Tom
OL,5,AJones
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Tom Jones has said ITV "fired" him
OL,8,Fas a judge on The Voice, and he did not
OL,9,Fwant to leave as he "loves the show".
OL,11,FThe 86-year-old singer from Treforest
OL,12,Fin Pontypridd, Rhondda Cynon Taf, has
OL,13,Fappeared as an on-off coach on the
OL,14,Fsinging competition since it premiered
OL,15,Fin 2012.
OL,17,FFollowing rumours that he may not
OL,18,Freturn to the panel for the upcoming
OL,19,Fseries, Sir Tom said the broadcaster
OL,20,Fdecided a while ago, but he "was told
OL,21,Frecently".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
